1. react : javaScript library 
use to create complex fronted/UI
components base library 
phele pure page ko reload krna pdta tha ek bhi components ko update krne k liye 
react : components based architecture :
puri website ko components me baat do
jo change hoga vhi render hoga baki components same hi rahenge 


a.library : ek particular feature ko implement kr ne ke liye 
-GSAP : Moving animation
-Lenis : smooth scrolling 
-ReactJs : UI banane k liye 

b.framework : sab kuch ek ho form me inbuilt 
-Nextjs : 
-Talwinds  : pura style 


2. import and export : data ko ek file se dusre file me send and recieve krne k liye 
 
 export has 2 type : 

 a. default export 
 b. named export 

// named export : curly bracket and name vo chahiye 
 export let arr = [1,2,3,4,5];
import {arr} from './app.js'
console.log(arr);

// default export : 
let a = 22;
export default a;
import a from from './app.js'

3. Real DOM vs Virtual DOM : 

Real DOM : actual dom  : vo tree like structure : 
usme kuch bhi update krna to pura dom re-render hota hai

but hme aisa nhi chahiye but jo update ho use hi re-render krna pdega : 

// Virtual DOM : Real dom ko copy banata hai 
// koi bhi update krna hai use chane kro and vo compare krega real dom se and vo changes hoge use hi re-render hoga extra components re-render nhi hoge :
faltu k rendering nhi hogi : 

jsx : javaScript xml : HTML + javaScript :
app js me html likh skte ho

4. Making react folder with vite : 

vite : react ka folder banata hai :

1.npm create vite 
2.folde ka naam : 
3.cd folder
4. npm install
5. npm run dev

folder-structure : index.html > main.jsx > App.jsx

